# Household UI

Follow `design/philosophy.md` and the Schloss mockups. Accent is teal `#1DB8A6` on wash `#F4FBF9`, not Google blue.

- Keep tabs **Tasks, Shopping, Pinboard, Finances**. Extra tools stay in the household sheet.
- Pinboard = notices, not chat. No leaderboard home.
- List complete controls stay **circular** (`.complete-toggle`). Square boxes only inside member chips/forms.
- Primary actions are **pill** buttons. Active chips and nav use sage fill/tint.
- Do not restyle toward google.com or mint-game mascots unless Sascha asks.
